Tested-by: Diederik de Haas <diederik@cknow-tech.com>  # NanoPC-T6 LTS, Rock 5B
Tested-by: Igor Paunovic <royalnet026@gmail.com> # RK3588 Orange Pi 5 Plus, dual HDMI
Tested-by: Robin Räber <robin.raebi@gmail.com>
